ENGLISH

The source code in this repository is published openly for one purpose only:
to allow independent verification of how the platform processes and protects
users' personal and health-related data.

You may:
  • view and study the code;
  • analyse it for vulnerabilities and report findings as described in SECURITY.md;
  • quote excerpts for research or educational purposes with attribution.

You may NOT, without the copyright holder's written permission:
  • use this code or any part of it in other projects, commercial or otherwise;
  • copy, distribute, modify, or publish derivative works;
  • use the site's name, design, or content.

THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND.
